- `toOwnerDto(Owner)` (lines 28-41) with many `@Mapping(... expression = "java(...)")` derived fields (`displayName`, `initials`, `telephoneDisplay`, `householdId`, `identityKey`, `checkDigit`, `membershipNumber`, `membershipPoints`, `membershipLevel`, `locality`, `contactPreference`, `ageBand`) — builds the `201` response body.

